 ['Horizontal asymptote of $\\dfrac{2x+3}{x^{2}-4x-32}$?','Horizontal asymptote of $\\dfrac{6x^{2}}{3x^{2}+1}$?','Domain of $\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}-49}$?'],
 'Q1 $y=0$. Q2 $y=2$. Q3 All reals except $x=\\pm7$.',
